          "Store residues as uint32_t and use ping-pong matrix buffers to avoid the copy-back pass.",
          "Transpose the right operand and use ARM64 NEON widening products with independent accumulators, followed by an exact bounded 128-bit modular fold.",
          "Parallelize independent output rows only when OpenMP is enabled and the matrix is sufficiently large, with a scalar fallback retained."
        ]
